<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1733_6365.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündtlich</unclear>, nachparlich, grueß, unnd dienst
<lb n="2"/>zuvor, Fürsichtige, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ersame</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Weiße</unclear>, besonders
<lb n="3"/>liebe Freündt, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guete</unclear> Nachparn.
<lb n="4"/>Was E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ehr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. an unns umb nachlaßung, oder
<lb n="5"/>milterung ihres burgers <persName resp="#ner">Jacob <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wetzers</unclear></persName>
<lb n="6"/>abgestrafften 36. Rhgl. halber intercedendo ge=
<lb n="7"/>langen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solches</unclear> haben wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seines</unclear> in=
<lb n="8"/>halts mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrerm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernomen</unclear>.
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wiewohl</unclear> wir sollich ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">firbittschreiben</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">achtung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zunemen</unclear> nit ungenaigt, in ansehung,
<lb n="11"/>unnd betrachtung, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear> wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ehr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. unnd
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegewandten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> aller <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündtwillig=</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khait</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bestendiger</unclear> nachparschafft,
<lb n="14"/>unnd vertreülicher correspondentz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorderist</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewogen</unclear>; <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> aber bemelts Jacob
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wetzers</unclear> verbrechen vil <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anderst</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vil=</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leicht</unclear> E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. informirt, unnd berichtet,
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gestaltet</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschaffen</unclear>, in dem er nit allain
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bestelte</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschworne</unclear> diener, die
<lb n="20"/>Kornmeßer, Hüeter, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Vögel</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unverschuld=</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>er dingen mit schmehlichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wortten</unclear> iniuriert,
<lb n="22"/>und angetastet, sonder auch unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbsten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> der
<lb n="23"/>oberkhait mit offentlichen ungrundt ver=
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">clainerlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuegeredt</unclear>, alls <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemain=</unclear>
<lb n="25"/>er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> Statt <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-552" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spital</unclear></orgName> wegen Branden=
<lb n="26"/>burgischen durchzugs erloest, dahero er
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1733_6366.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="27"/>und Andere solchen widerumb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fillen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muessen</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirdts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darzue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guett</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear>, biß sich
